<p data-source-line="381"><strong>Expected:</strong> five alerts with a colored bar and a title matching the kind, the
multi-block alert keeps its list, code, and paragraph inside the bar, and the
last quote is an ordinary quote with the bracketed text visible. The lowercase
marker currently renders as an ordinary quote with <code>[!note]</code> visible, because
only uppercase markers are recognized (tracked in #222); an engine that
compares the marker case-insensitively shows a Note instead.</p>
